    "error.actionGone" : {
      "comment" : "Message of the refusal for making a card of the retired kind action.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "action is gone. What a part does is written as a flow: begin (kind: begin; trigger: receive to be called) → process node (kind: process; put the rows for read, write, sign, check, call, send, receive and compute in steps) → end (kind: end; what it returns goes in return). To call another flow and wait for it to finish, use a run node (kind: run). For the form, see guide's about: flow"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "action はなくなりました。部品がすることは flow で書きます: 開始（kind: begin。trigger: receive で受ける） → 処理ノード（kind: process。読む・書く・署名・確かめる・呼ぶ・送る・受ける・計算するの行を steps に）→ 終了（kind: end。返すものは return）。ほかの flow を呼んで終わりを待つのは実行ノード（kind: run）。形は guide の about: flow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "error.moveCantOpen" : {
      "comment" : "Error when a moved project cannot be opened at the destination. The argument is the reason.",
